{"unit_id":"tdyangbo__PianpianUI#feature-background","repo":"tdyangbo/PianpianUI","commit":"c46003a30bf3cbf9a2cd06137196eac3b9cfabb7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"PianpianUI 的功能「聊天背景」：在 DSH Web 聊天页面显示内置插画背景，并用叠加样式维持界面区域的透明效果；页面样式由客户端模块加载器接入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:28-39","lib/client.js:866-880"]}
